se strong reliability and stress handling, technical competence, despite some communication tone issues that can be mitigated.\n\nWe need to reference discussion (none) but can say \"Given the criteria, I lean towards B\". Provide evidence: B very conscientious, handles stress well, good at weather, but note pretentiousness.\n\nLet's produce."}
